             r"\textbf{Statuses}: the identity is [DERIVED] and conditional (given a contortion); the cross-check is [REAL]. The rewriting solves neither the connection equation nor the antisymmetric sector; $B$ is not automatically conserved on its own; $\Theta$ must be the source of the chosen action and may depend on $C$; the modular torsion of matrices does not replace spacetime torsion. The physical contortion $C(\psi,\beta)$ remains [OPEN]."
