              ("beta do resultado == beta recomputado", bool(abs(float(rj.get("beta", 0)) - beta) < 1e-15)),
              ("instrumento lalsuite (ajuste EOB de estado final) registrado", bool(inst.get("lalsuite") and "EOB" in str(inst.get("final_state", "")))),
